Follow AGENTS.md and docs/ as the single source of truth.

Before changing Rust code, read docs/architecture.md and docs/coding-standards.md. Read product-requirements, session-state-machine, intent-and-actions, testing, and roadmap when relevant.

Do not duplicate project documentation. Update relevant docs when changing architecture, state transitions, intents, actions, or module boundaries. Run cargo fmt and cargo test after Rust changes.
